    "In your tablet driver, enable Force Proportions (强制等比例) and match the tablet area to the screen's aspect ratio. Without it, circles draw as ellipses.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In your tablet driver, enable Force Proportions (强制等比例) and match the tablet area to the screen's aspect ratio. Without it, circles draw as ellipses."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans le pilote de votre tablette, activez Force Proportions (proportions forcées) et faites correspondre la zone de la tablette au rapport d'aspect de l'écran. Sinon, les cercles deviennent des ellipses."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "タブレットドライバーで Force Proportions（強制等比例）を有効にし、タブレット領域を画面のアスペクト比に合わせてください。円が楕円になります。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "태블릿 드라이버에서 Force Proportions(강제 비율 유지)를 켜고 태블릿 영역을 화면 비율에 맞추세요. 그렇지 않으면 원이 타원으로 그려집니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在绘图板驱动程序中开启 Force Proportions（强制等比例），并让绘图区符合屏幕长宽比。否则圆会画成椭圆。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在繪圖板驅動程式中開啟 Force Proportions（強制等比例），並讓繪圖區符合螢幕長寬比。否則圓會畫成橢圓。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
