    "Presets map the actions this app has. Tools the source app has and we do not are left out, not faked.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presets map the actions this app has. Tools the source app has and we do not are left out, not faked."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les préréglages correspondent aux actions de cette app. Les outils de l'app source que nous n'avons pas sont omis, pas simulés."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "プリセットはこのアプリの動作だけを割り当てます。元アプリにあってもここにない道具は省きます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "프리셋은 이 앱에 있는 동작만 매핑합니다. 원본 앱에만 있는 도구는 빠지며 흉내 내지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "预设只映射本应用已有的动作。源应用有而这里没有的工具会被略过，不会伪造。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "預設集對應此應用程式有的動作。來源應用程式有而我們沒有的工具會被略過，不會假造。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press and draw here with a pen. A mouse draws at full pressure.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Press and draw here with a pen. A mouse draws at full pressure."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appuyez et dessinez ici avec un stylet. Une souris dessine à pleine pression."
          }
